glad (https://github.com/Dav1dde/glad) is a code generator that creates this
OpenGL loader based on the official Khronos specifications.

The generated loader source (src/glad.c, include/glad/glad.h) is placed in
the public domain by the glad project itself. From the glad README:

    "The generated code is not covered by the LICENSE, it is dedicated to
    the public domain, as much as possible under the applicable law."

Alternatively, at your option, you may use the following Unlicense text
for the generated loader source:

